{"document":1,"title":"user in #618f13b2:answer_caf5b52e_1: I need help organizing my shoe closet. I have a bu...","updated_at":"2023-05-30T22:27:00+00:00","source_type":"slack","content":"I'm glad I could help with the cleaning tips. I think I'll also sort my shoes by type and color, it'll make it easier to find what I need. And, I'm happy to report that I've worn my new black Converse Chuck Taylor All Star sneakers four times already, including to my friend's birthday party last Saturday. They're so comfortable and I love how they go with my jeans and dresses.

